OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny but chilly to start, with
OL,6,Fcoastal showers fading. Cloud
OL,7,Fincreases from the west and northwest,
OL,8,Fbringing strengthening winds and
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain, locally heavy over
OL,10,Fhigher ground. Rain continues to move
OL,11,Feastwards through the afternoon. Cool
OL,12,Ffor most.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain reaches the southeast
OL,15,Fthrough the evening. Staying cloudy
OL,16,Fwith outbreaks of rain elsewhere, with
OL,17,Fheaviest in the north and on high
OL,18,Fground. Wind increasing from the west.
OL,19,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
