OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloud and rain clear in the
OL,6,Fnorth to leave sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers, some heavy. Breezy with
OL,8,Fstrong coastal winds. Temperatures
OL,9,Fnear average, but warmer across
OL,10,Fsouthern and eastern areas.
